      "message": "\"consume_skb\" is for `EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(consume_skb)` in net/core/skbuff.c. You are adding a tracepoint (`EXPORT_TRACEPOINT_SYMBOL_GPL(consume_skb)`) which would require the symbols:\n```\n__tracepoint_consume_skb\n__traceiter_consume_skb\n```\n\nIf you don\u0027t need those symbols, then you should abandon this patch.",
